Hi Puneeth, this group is most helpful when you try to make what progress you can on your own, and then ask for help when you get stuck. You will need to work through the Shiny tutorial <https://shiny.rstudio.com/tutorial/> at the very least.

If you're asking whether what you're describing is feasible in Shiny, yes, very much so. See the Hadoop section on this page <https://cran.r-project.org/web/views/HighPerformanceComputing.html> for a pointer to some useful packages for connecting to Hadoop from R. To create download buttons for Shiny you can look at this article <https://shiny.rstudio.com/articles/download.html>.

