Are the additional columns only used on a certain page? Or did you really intend that the act of navigating to a certain page will permanently enhance the data with additional columns, to be used on all pages (because that sounds a bit strange)? If the former, then the way you can do that is to create a reactive expression that enhances a copy of the data (without modifying the underlying data.table), and only refer to that reactive expression from outputs that are on the relevant page.

