I have built a basic app on shiny which connects to Hadoop and run the query to fetch the results. I have set of filters too.
Now when I set a certain filter, I get for ex: 5000 rows and now I need to generate a random sample of 500 observations and generate an excel.

My UI would be something like this:
sliderInput(inputId = "observations",
         label = "Number of observations:",
         min = 10,
         max = 1000,
         value = 500

Any suggestions on how to proceed.

